@startuml AgentPay Purchase Sequence
!theme plain
title Purchase with threshold approval and x402 v2

actor Buyer
actor "Approver A" as A
actor "Approver B" as B
participant "Go API" as API
participant "Evidence" as Evidence
participant "x402 facilitator" as Facilitator
participant "Seller API" as Seller

Buyer -> API : POST /v1/intents
API -> API : Resolve route, freeze quote, evaluate policy
API --> Buyer : 201 intent (requiresApproval=true)
Buyer -> API : POST /intents/{id}/approval-sessions
API -> Evidence : append approval.requested
API --> Buyer : session + two invitation URLs
A -> API : approve with invitation token
API -> Evidence : append approval.decided
B -> API : approve with invitation token
API -> Evidence : append approval.decided + approval.resolved
API --> B : approved + one-time approval token
Buyer -> API : paid-route request + intent + approval token
API -> API : validate complete intent hash
API --> Buyer : 402 + PAYMENT-REQUIRED
Buyer -> API : retry + PAYMENT-SIGNATURE
API -> Facilitator : verify and settle testnet payment
Facilitator --> API : settlement response
API -> Evidence : append payment.verified
API -> API : conditional claim for forwarding
API -> Seller : signed allowlisted request
Seller --> API : response
API -> Evidence : append delivery.succeeded/failed
API --> Buyer : seller response + transaction ID + PAYMENT-RESPONSE
@enduml

